<title>USA: Pathmark Stores names James Donald chairman.</title>
<headline>Pathmark Stores names James Donald chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBRIDGE, N.J. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pathmark Stores Inc, a 143-store supermarket chain, said Monday that it named James Donald chairman, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Donald succeeds Jack Futterman, who retired, the company said.</p>
<p>Donald joins Pathmark from Safeway Inc, where he has served as senior vice president and manager of the company's 130-store eastern division since 1994.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
